00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.580
Here's what you need to know about Tesla today.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:20.080
A 379,000-mile 2019 Model 3 in Canada still shows strong battery health, giving owners

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.640
