00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:28.040
Tesla relies on these stations for both customer convenience and brand visibility.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:33.340
Repair costs and downtime affect the reliability narrative around the network.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:39.940
An owner in Canada tested a 2019 Model 3 with 379,000 miles.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:45.300
The pack retained usable capacity well above typical expectations for that mileage.

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:50.920
The results add to the record of real-world Tesla battery longevity outside warranty.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:55.860
Owners and buyers can reference these figures when assessing used vehicle values.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:01.680
High mileage battery data turns every long-serving Tesla into a rolling laboratory.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:08.460
Calendar aging and charge cycle wear do not automatically render packs un-economic after warranty

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:14.480
