00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:20.700
daily driving for years ahead. When degradation stays predictable, the secondary market expands

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:24.580
and supports higher new vehicle prices through stronger trade-ins.

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:30.520
The same data also informs Tesla's insurance and financing products with lower uncertainty

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:36.940
than competitors. Real-world pack health metrics let the company price policies and loans more

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:42.840
precisely. Lower risk translates into thinner margins on those services while still remaining

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:49.380
